Z||000003||Pretender||03-06-2000||03:55 PM||||Well I called and placed an order for a set! I got the uncoated ones, the coated ones were $190 more. They were $550. Plus $45 for shipping. Phil was very nice and seemed very knowledgable. Also he claimed a dyno figure of +25HP. but thats probably at the motor? eitherway I'll tell you guys all about how the install goes and the 1/4 mile times that I get. I'd like to thank the IRS for making this possable(GO REFUND!). talk to you guys later, shawn. ||||reg||4
